{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"lovable-well-sheldrake","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_overlap_retrieve.py:63-69` — Preserve overlap-retrieval ordering and boundary behavior. Consumer: evaluation maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_packaging_dependencies.py:1-12, 60-69, 107-113` — Preserve dependency and override constraints. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_pai_output.py:1-19, AC-numbered docstrings through 313` — Preserve adapter output and retry contracts. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_pai_tools_read_file_range_4c2b.py:1-27` — Preserve bounded-range behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_pai_tools_search_files_bf31.py:1-26, 143-158` — Preserve file-versus-directory search behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_pass1_finder_model.py:1-12, 31-36, 153-168` — Preserve finder model-class and bin-sizing invariants. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_pass1_recall.py:1-9, 87-92` — Preserve recall and replay behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_path_injection_guards.py:1-14, 147-159` — Preserve containment and error-redaction guarantees. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_pin_health_store_scan_count.py:1-12` — Preserve bounded store-scan behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_pinned_ticket_view.py:637-644, 662-669, 688-694, 851-858` — Preserve Git-object and projection invariants. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_oversize_coaching_1e48.py:1-14` — Preserve required concision coaching. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_relation_snapshot.py:325-334, 369-377, 444-456, 498-510, 618-628` — Preserve unrelated-dirt tolerance and strict tracked-state checks. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_attest_drift.py:1-16` — Preserve read-set-scoped invalidation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_cli_retry.py:1-15, 48-52` — Preserve real-CLI retry coverage. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_completion.py:1-17` — Preserve separate completion sub-call behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_discovery.py:1-13` — Preserve discovery checkpoint and outcome contracts. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_docs_url.py:1-8` — Preserve consumer-resolvable default URL behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_drift_floor.py:1-8, 257-262` — Preserve drift-floor and shared-head-anchor behavior. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_overlap_retrieve.py tests/unit/test_packaging_dependencies.py tests/unit/test_pai_output.py tests/unit/test_pai_tools_read_file_range_4c2b.py tests/unit/test_pai_tools_search_files_bf31.py tests/unit/test_pass1_finder_model.py tests/unit/test_pass1_recall.py tests/unit/test_path_injection_guards.py tests/unit/test_pin_health_store_scan_count.py tests/unit/test_pinned_ticket_view.py tests/unit/test_plan_oversize_coaching_1e48.py tests/unit/test_plan_relation_snapshot.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_attest_drift.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_cli_retry.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_completion.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_discovery.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_docs_url.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_drift_floor.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"7e11-5a48-6000-48c2","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit — cohort 20: overlap_retrieve–plan_review_drift_floor"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571582871823037,"uuid":"14de41dc-7494-4aed-892d-0fb525f3288d"}